      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIGHTY MIKADO (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 350m (19.73). Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of six tries. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. CHEETAH MOON (2) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (17.21) there the start prior. Has a good record here at this journey. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. WILE COYOTE (3) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (20.07) in a Grade 5 at this track. Can hit the frame this time. IRINKA ASHLEY (4) is worth some thought after placing at this track and distance last start.",
